---
import LegalDocLayout from "../../../components/LegalDocLayout.astro";

const title = "Recommendation technologies — PRIME";
const description =
  "How PRIME uses recommendation and analytics technologies on the English site.";
---

<LegalDocLayout title={title} description={description} path="/en/legal/recommendations/">
  <h1>Rules for recommendation technologies</h1>
  <p class="legal-lead">
    PRIME LLC (ООО «ПРАЙМ», INN 3665107119), address: 394026, Voronezh, Moskovsky Prospekt 19,
    office 19. Site: <a href="https://prime-ltd.su/en/">https://prime-ltd.su/en/</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
  <p>
    We may use information technologies that collect and analyse how visitors interact with the
    site in order to improve content, measure effectiveness of digital marketing materials and —
    where applicable — show more relevant information. These rules follow the approach required
    under Russian Federal Law No. 149-FZ (information / information technologies) for disclosure
    of recommendation technologies.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data that may be collected</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>actions on the site (clicks, scrolls, form submits, downloads);</li>
    <li>search or filter queries on the site (if any);</li>
    <li>IP address and approximate location (country / region / city);</li>
    <li>cookie and similar identifiers;</li>
    <li>pages viewed, visit count, session duration, entry/exit points;</li>
    <li>browser, OS, screen parameters, time zone, date/time of visit;</li>
    <li>traffic sources and UTM parameters.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Technologies and third parties (English site)</h2>
  <p>On English pages we typically rely on:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com (font delivery);
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>First-party site scripts</strong> on prime-ltd.su (UI, forms, locale preference, cookie consent);
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Email / contact</strong> — messages you send to
      <a href="mailto:info@prime-ltd.su">info@prime-ltd.su</a>;
    </li>
    <li>
      optional messaging links (e.g. Telegram, VK) if you choose to open them — without loading their
      trackers as part of site recommendation tech.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Yandex Metrica and Yandex Maps widgets are used on the Russian site version and are listed in the
    <a href="/legal/recommendations/">Russian recommendation rules</a>. They are not loaded on English
    pages by default.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Who uses the data</h2>
  <p>
    Aggregated or individual analytics may be used by authorised PRIME marketers, analysts and
    product staff to improve the site and services. We do not sell this data.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about recommendation technologies:
    <a href="mailto:info@prime-ltd.su">info@prime-ltd.su</a>.
    See also the <a href="/en/legal/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> and
    <a href="/en/legal/cookies/">Cookie policy</a>.
  </p>
</LegalDocLayout>
